TEXT -800 424 Left 2 ;ACTIVE-CLAMP FLYBACK 400V -> 54V/1A, 10kHz, n=10:1\n;M1/M2 = Infineon IMBF170R1K0M1 (1700V, 1 ohm SiC), datasheet-fit model\n;Cclamp+M2 replace the RCD snubber: leakage energy is recycled\n;Lm=25mH: magnetising current swings negative -> ZVS, no dead-time ringing\n;hs/ls = complementary PWM with 0.5us dead-time\n;Vss/Baw = duty soft-start + error-amp anti-windup clamp\n;Istep = 1A -> 0.5A -> 1A load step (220-260ms) to check the loop
